# Security-sensitive infrastructure & deployment config.
#
# These files can grant platform-admin access (ADMIN_EMAILS in wrangler.toml),
# change what a CI job or self-hosted runner can reach, or alter the sandbox
# container's privileges — a plain merge is enough to take effect, with no
# additional approval step. Added after the Sep 4, 2026 infra pen-test found
# an admin-allowlist grant (commit 27afb72b) land as an ordinary, unreviewed
# commit. Require the repo owner's review on these specifically so changes to
# them get a deliberate look, without adding review overhead anywhere else.
# (AQU pen-test: Infrastructure & deployment security review — Sep 4, 2026)

